Z||000000||BN Boomer||06-24-2000||12:08 AM||||I guess you never know about some of these urban myths, but I was just told that the local high school shop teacher has an entire complete Fiero V-6 cradle assembly that has been sitting in the back of the shop for sometime and he is now considering selling it. Supposedly it is from a new car the was damaged while in transit on the railroad and was donated to the school for educational purposes. If there is any truth to this, it has obviously this has been sitting for some time but the word is that the car only had 7 miles on it when the cradle was dropped. I'll definitely be looking into this one. ||||reg||1
